docs {
  # getGatewayPCBSerialNumber

  Get Gateway PCB serial number.

  ## Required service level

  `none`

  ## Body

  `none`

  ## Response

  `200 OK` (PCBSerialNumber)

  ### Example

  ```json
  {
	"Value": "PCB123456"
  }
  ```
}

